<title>GERMANY: Bonn to top up New Year Bond by one bln dmk - Buba.</title>
<headline>Bonn to top up New Year Bond by one bln dmk - Buba.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German government will top up its 10-year, six percent coupon New Year bond by one billion marks to 28 billion, the Bundesbank as issuing agent said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The additional portion of the bond will be placed on the market by the Bundesbank from February 17 as part of its normal market-smoothing operations, the bank said.</p>
<p>The bond matures on January 4, 2007.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
